<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telesp cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telesp cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings analysts Patrick Jurczak, Andrew Friedman and Vera Rossi on Wednesday cut their rating for Brazilian telecommunications company Telesp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- They recommended investors switch into telephone holding Telebras because of better returns.</p>
<p>-- They raised their 12-month price target to $330 per 1,000-share lot.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 2.99 reais to 296 reais on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
